y applying the inverse Laplace transform to the above result, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t} & =\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+9} \\\\ {L}^{-1}{L{\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t}} & ={L}^{-1}{\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+9}} \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡3t & ={L}^{-1}{\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+9}} \\\\ {L}^{-1}{\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+9}} & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the multiplicative property of the inverse Laplace transform, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\cdot {L}^{-1}{\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+9}}=4\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡3t \\\\ {L}^{-1}{\\frac{4s}{{s}^{2}+9}}=4\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399478 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399479 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399480 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399481 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399482 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399479 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399477 1080 #uuid "caf67a00-882f-5531-9d3d-d727009d9381" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399478 1081 "{L}^{-1}{F(s)}=\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399478 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399478 1084 #uuid "c0cbb343-c5b6-5165-b8dd-e5752f164d76" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399479 1081 "{L}^{-1}{F(s)}=4\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399479 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399479 1084 #uuid "a59bbe62-a208-5df3-8661-8ea4f1d189bc" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399480 1081 "{L}^{-1}{F(s)}=\\f