00 \\\\ x+8 & =\\pm \\sqrt{-100} \\\\ x+8 & =\\pm 10\\,\\text{i} \\\\ x & =-8\\pm 10\\,\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation has two solutions, $x=-8+10\\,\\text{i}$ and $x=-8-10\\,\\text{i}.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399577 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399578 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399579 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399580 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399581 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399579 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1080 #uuid "042ad804-2249-5399-b919-45947b7e0d31" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399577 1081 "p+q=-108,\\,x=10\\pm 8\\,\\text{i}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399577 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399577 1084 #uuid "8b7d8b31-ae04-5df6-aeb1-961f777e33b7" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399578 1081 "p+q=-108,\\,x=-8\\pm 10\\,\\text{i}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399578 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399578 1084 #uuid "3477ce1f-9124-5c8e-aee7-0c19aaa37d5c" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1081 "p+q=-92,\\,x=-8\\pm 10\\,\\text{i}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1084 #uuid "516e48e9-f368-58d1-b1c7-a413f32276d7" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399580 1081 "p+q=-92,\\,x=10\\pm 8\\,\\text{i}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399580 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186